WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.727
Do not assume every view is writable.

00:00:02.727 --> 00:00:07.307
A simple single table view may support automatic updates.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:12.447
A join or aggregate view does not have the same direct row mapping.

00:00:12.447 --> 00:00:19.387
Materialized views are stored query results, not ordinary write through interfaces.

00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:24.816
Always check the actual Postgres behavior for the view definition you are designing.
